 "summary": "Seven 1 A general purpose silicon rectifier diodes with a glass passivated junction in the two-lead SMA surface mount package, differing only in reverse voltage rating from 50 V (S1A) to 1000 V (S1M). Forward drop is 1.1 V max at 1 A, reverse leakage 5 µA max at rated DC voltage and 25 °C, and a 30 A surge of one 8.3 ms half sine is allowed. S1J is the 600 V type.",
